==Battleground==
*2 [[Sir Metal Seal]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*10 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*10 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Tarsiriel]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*20 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is possible to chip down the Tarsiriel here over time with attackers like [[Masked Grandmaster Cat]], [[Awakened Naala]], [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Soractes]] or [[Awakened Mina]] and [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]].
Tarsiriel tends to completely miss [[Catasaurus]], so it will be able to deal with the Sir Metal Seals.[[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|Anti-Metal]] [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|crowd-controllers]] such as [[Mochi Cat]], [[Hoopmaster Cat]], [[Puppetmaster Cat]] can help to subdue the Sir Metal Seals.

It's also possible to cheese the base in under a minute with lv50 [[Royal Guard Cat]], lv50 [[Future Cat]] and lv50 [[Green Shell Cat]] and a Research Combo (M) or equivalent. (No-Gacha uses '''Aerial Recon'''.) Start the battle by spamming [[Future Cat]] off cooldown, then [[Green Shell Cat]] as soon as possible and finally use [[Royal Guard Cat]] only when he can be afforded - don't stop spamming [[Future Cat]]. The base dies in under a minute if done correctly: the [[Gabriel]] cannot even land an attack thanks to the interaction with [[Royal Guard Cat]]. Easy Z-material farming.

