==Trivia==
*Based on the theming of [[Konjac Valley]], Meandering Road's Japanese name, Guruguru Jidōshadō (ぐるぐる自動車道, "Revolving Expressway") may refer to the Internet being a technological revolution and an information superhighway linking the globe.
**Note that ぐるぐる ''guruguru'' (onomatopoeia for revolving) sounds similar to グーグル ''Gūguru'' ([[wikipedia:Google|Google]]) and 自動車道 ''jidōshadō'' (expressway) contains the word 自動車 ''jidōsha'' (car), therefore it could also be referencing the [[wikipedia:Google Self-Driving Car Project|Google Self-Driving Car Project]] or [[wikipedia:Google Drive|Google Drive]].
*Along with [[Groundscraper]], Meandering Road appears to have been designed specifically for [[Princess Kaguya (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultra Kaguya]], the [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]] alongside Konjac Valley. Ultra Kaguya gains Metal Killer, allowing her to deal extra damage to [[Croconator]] and [[Sir Metal Seal]], and is able to slow every enemy in the stage, as all are [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] or [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]].

